   </dc:title>
   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">HIspanic girl is sitting on the floor in front of a lit stone fireplace. She is playing with a stuffed clown and surrounded by other toys including a ball, stuffed duck and bear and a teapot, teacups, saucers, and a plate with cookies. You can see outside the window in the room and it is raining.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
